086-cike","source_id":"s-shiji-086-cike","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-086-cike:p007","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m007-0018","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/086.json"}],"interpretation_note":"保存本段死亡原語；日期未明者不逆算，不由死亡自動終止全部官爵。未核影像。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"normalized_date":{"era":"BCE","era_year":515,"year":-514,"year_numbering":"astronomical","precision":"year","status":"editorial_provisional","original_quote":"四月丙子，光伏甲士於窟室中，而具酒請王僚。王僚使兵陳自宮至光之家，門戸階陛左右，皆王僚之親戚也。夾立侍，皆持長鈹。酒既酣，公子光詳爲足疾，入窟室中，使專諸置匕首魚炙之腹中而進之。既至王前，專諸擘魚，因以匕首刺王僚，王僚立死。左右亦殺專諸，王人擾亂。公子光出其伏甲以攻王僚之徒，盡滅之，遂自立爲王，是爲闔閭。闔閭乃封專諸之子以爲上卿。","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-086-cike","source_id":"s-shiji-086-cike","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-086-cike:p007","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m007-0018","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/086.json"}],"references":[{"title":"《史記·十二諸侯年表》原紀年欄","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷014&oldid=2607001","quote":"十二公子光使專諸殺僚，自立。","scope":"received_parallel_event","image_verified":false,"table_cell_id":"shiji-014-r327-c15"},{"title":"《史記·十二諸侯年表》數位年欄","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷014&oldid=2607001","quote":"515","scope":"digital_editorial_regnal_year_equivalence_only","image_verified":false,"table_cell_id":"shiji-014-r327-c00"}],"rationale":"按本篇具體事件與固定年表原格對讀；西元數字取數位編者附加對照，不是受傳文本原有紀年。未核書影或曆表，只到年，不換算月日。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"basis":{"kind":"parallel_event","source_event_quote":"王僚立死","reference_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷014&oldid=2607001","reference_event_quote":"十二公子光使專諸殺僚，自立。","reference_year_quote":"515"}}}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m019-0073","start":73,"end":74,"surface":"僚","kind":"person","person_id":"5dm_e40_rqh_AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACA","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-031-wu:p019","chapter_id":"c-shiji-031-wu"},{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m020-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"王僚","kind":"person","person_id":"5dm_e40_rqh_AAAA